{
  "_notes": [
    "Mustang Limited Edition V1.45 (mt_145h). Upstream had no map for it.",
    "2026-11: compiled from the ROM image (README, 'Adjustments from the ROM').",
    "current_player/current_ball 0x000317D8/+1 and the status byte 0x0003180A (player + 0x32) from a",
    "headless game: 01 attract, 93/98/B5 play, 15 tilted; B5 equals 15 under 0x1F, so tilted is an",
    "enum over mask 0x3F.",
    "Confirmed on a cabinet 2026-11-13 (ALP4K; two players, tilt on P1 ball 1): 1,048,160 /",
    "1,221,190, the records and the status byte (01, 98 ball served, 93/B5 play, 15 tilted) matched",
    "the DMD."
  ],
